<title>ARGENTINA: Argentine Central Bank places $176 mln in repos.</title>
<headline>Argentine Central Bank places $176 mln in repos.</headline>
<dateline>BUENOS AIRES 1997-01-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Argentina's Central Bank said Monday it placed $176 million in overnight repurchase agreements at 9.0 percent against government bonds.</p>
<p>In the interbank market, call money fell to 5.35 percent from 5.50 percent at Friday's close.</p>
<p>The U.S. dollar rose to 0.99984 pesos from 0.99955 pesos.</p>
<p>((-- Buenos Aires Newsroom +541 318-0655))</p>
